sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Sales
    participant O as Ordering API
    participant C as Catalog API
    participant DB1 as OrderingDb
    participant DB2 as CatalogDb

    U->>O: POST /api/orders/{id}/confirm
    Note right of O: JWT Bearer
    O->>DB1: load Order + Lines
    O->>O: EnsureCanConfirm()
    O->>C: POST /internal/stocks/reserve
    C->>DB2: load Stock (rowversion)
    alt đủ tồn kho
        C->>DB2: Reserved += qty + STOCK_MOVEMENT
        C-->>O: 200 success
        O->>O: order.Confirm()
        O->>DB1: SaveChanges
        O-->>U: 200 OrderDto
    else thiếu tồn
        C-->>O: 409 shortages[]
        O-->>U: 409 STOCK_CONFLICT
        Note over O,DB1: Đơn giữ nguyên Draft
    end
    Note over O,C: SaveChanges lỗi → release (compensation)
